---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Contacto | Servicios de mantenimiento en Toluca | Mansir"
	description="Contacta a Mansir para solicitar servicios de mantenimiento integral, electricidad, plomería o remodelación en Toluca de Lerdo, Estado de México."
	keywords="contacto Mansir, solicitar mantenimiento Toluca, cotización de mantenimiento, servicios de mantenimiento Toluca, electricista en Toluca, plomero en Toluca, remodelación en Toluca, mantenimiento para casas, mantenimiento para negocios, construcción y reparaciones Estado de México"
>
	<main class="page-wrap py-10 sm:py-14 md:py-16">
		<header class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-2xl text-center md:mx-0 md:text-left">
			<p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-primary">Estamos para ayudarte</p>
			<h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-stone-950 sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl dark:text-stone-50">Contacto</h1>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-stone-600 sm:text-lg dark:text-stone-300">
				Cuéntanos qué necesitas. Nuestro equipo te responderá para encontrar la solución adecuada para tu espacio.
			</p>
		</header>

		<div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(18rem,0.8fr)] lg:gap-12">
			<form action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST" class="rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm sm:p-7 dark:border-stone-800 dark:bg-stone-900">
				<input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="PEGA_AQUI_TU_ACCESS_KEY_DE_WEB3FORMS" />
				<div class="grid gap-5">
					<div>
						<label for="name" class="mb-2 block text-center text-sm font-medium text-stone-800 md:text-left dark:text-stone-100">Nombre</label>
						<input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Nombre" autocomplete="name" required class="w-full rounded-lg border border-stone-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-base text-stone-900 outline-none transition placeholder:text-stone-400 focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/20 dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-950 dark:text-stone-100 dark:placeholder:text-stone-500" />
					</div>
					<div>
						<label for="email" class="mb-2 block text-center text-sm font-medium text-stone-800 md:text-left dark:text-stone-100">Correo</label>
						<input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="Correo" autocomplete="email" required class="w-full rounded-lg border border-stone-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-base text-stone-900 outline-none transition placeholder:text-stone-400 focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/20 dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-950 dark:text-stone-100 dark:placeholder:text-stone-500" />
					</div>
					<div>
						<label for="message" class="mb-2 block text-center text-sm font-medium text-stone-800 md:text-left dark:text-stone-100">Mensaje</label>
						<textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Mensaje" rows="5" required class="w-full resize-y rounded-lg border border-stone-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-base text-stone-900 outline-none transition placeholder:text-stone-400 focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/20 dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-950 dark:text-stone-100 dark:placeholder:text-stone-500"></textarea>
					</div>
					<button type="submit" class="mx-auto w-full rounded-lg bg-primary px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:brightness-90 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary sm:w-fit md:mx-0 dark:text-stone-950">Enviar mensaje</button>
				</div>
			</form>

			<aside class="rounded-xl bg-primary-soft p-5 text-center sm:p-7 md:text-left dark:bg-stone-900">
				<h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-stone-950 dark:text-stone-50">Dónde nos encontramos</h2>
				<address class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-stone-700 not-italic dark:text-stone-300">
					Paloma Perdiz 62<br />
					Las Palomas, 50250<br />
					Toluca de Lerdo, Méx.
				</address>
				<div class="mt-7 border-t border-primary/20 pt-5 dark:border-stone-700">
					<h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-100">Horario de atención</h3>
					<dl class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-sm text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
						<dt>Todos los días</dt><dd>24/7</dd>
					</dl>
				</div>
			</aside>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>